     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">關於印這種星星，有一種比較好理解的方法</span></p><p style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-b0TVFcMKbE0/Ws7523ICgTI/AAAAAAAAARo/CWUrvSdaaTUpr-UXaQ1vkMiL__pyCRCzACLcBGAs/s1600/test.PNG\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-b0TVFcMKbE0/Ws7523ICgTI/AAAAAAAAARo/CWUrvSdaaTUpr-UXaQ1vkMiL__pyCRCzACLcBGAs/s1600/test.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237464557000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1HbkmPei_vUq4-4V4Vxae6\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-b0TVFcMKbE0/Ws7523ICgTI/AAAAAAAAARo/CWUrvSdaaTUpr-UXaQ1vkMiL__pyCRCzACLcBGAs/s1600/test.PNG\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;clear:both\">此圖為一99乘法表，透過此表可以發現兩個規律，分別為圖中兩條線，i+j=10與i=j</p><p style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;clear:both\">只要有這兩條線</p><p style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;clear:both\">就可以圈出各種三角形</p><p style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;clear:both\">例如</p><p style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-TmRhGaZF0Ug/Ws77Q5F1IhI/AAAAAAAAAR0/YQVyQ9nl-v8gzVzb_PSaRQfdHhcqXVo-ACLcBGAs/s1600/%25E5%25B7%25A6%25E7%259B%25B4%25E8%25A7%2592.PNG\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-TmRhGaZF0Ug/Ws77Q5F1IhI/AAAAAAAAAR0/YQVyQ9nl-v8gzVzb_PSaRQfdHhcqXVo-ACLcBGAs/s1600/%2525E5%2525B7%2525A6%2525E7%25259B%2525B4%2525E8%2525A7%252592.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237464557000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0hkcif4CecOaa2SIWRq55h\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-TmRhGaZF0Ug/Ws77Q5F1IhI/AA